gametitle=Midnight Club 3: DUB Edition Remix PAL
comment=PAL FreeCam + Teleport + Air Anchor Release
comment=Game ID SLES-53717 / CRC 208183AF
comment=X in FreeCam: teleport vehicle to FreeCam position with normal physics
comment=Square in FreeCam: teleport vehicle and enable Air Anchor
comment=Square again: release Air Anchor and resume physics
comment=Leaving FreeCam while anchored: automatic release
comment=Includes tested FreeCam controls, FOV restore/reset, cinematic mode and menu/garage safety

// RELEASE BUILD
// Functional patch stream is kept byte-for-byte and in the same order as tested V210.
// Historical diagnostic comments were removed only; tested code/counters were not altered.
